<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Main Results. Comparison with existing open- and closed-source models. P&amp;R-RL denotes optimization of perception and reasoning in a single stage; R-RL denotes reasoning-only training; and P+R-RL denotes a two-stage approach with separate optimization of perception and reasoning. For models with 3B or 7B parameter sizes, bold and underlined values indicate the top-1 and top-2 performance, respectively. * indicates results reproduced by us.</figcaption>
