<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Comparison Between Original and Extended SFT Datasets</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since the model exhibited noticeable performance degradation in certain aspects after supervised fine-tuning (SFT) on the original Mulberry dataset, we supplemented the SFT data. The following section introduces the sources of the additional data and compares model performance before and after the supplementation.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Details of the Additional SFT Samples</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To enhance the diversity and robustness of the SFT data, we added approximately 39K samples from CLEVR-Math, DVQA, TabMWP, VQA2.0, Super-CLEVR, GeoQA+, and a selection of sampled hard cases. Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.1 Details of the Additional SFT Samples ‣ Appendix B Comparison Between Original and Extended SFT Datasets ‣ Perception Before Reasoning: Two-Stage Reinforcement Learning for Visual Reasoning in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> provides a detailed breakdown of the dataset sizes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Data source</th>
<th id="A2.T6.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Data size</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T6.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Clevr_Math</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">9730</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
