<td id="A2.T6.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">8676</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">TabMWP</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4908</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">VQA2.0</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3298</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">Super-CLEVR</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2398</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">GeoQA+</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1336</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">Hard Cases</th>
<td id="A2.T6.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">8786</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Data sources and sample sizes of the 39K supplemental SFT dataset.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Effect of Dataset Expansion on Model Performance</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After supplementing the training data, the overall performance of the model improved noticeably. Table <a href="#A2.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ B.2 Effect of Dataset Expansion on Model Performance ‣ Appendix B Comparison Between Original and Extended SFT Datasets ‣ Perception Before Reasoning: Two-Stage Reinforcement Learning for Visual Reasoning in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> presents a comparison of Qwen2.5-VL-7B’s performance on MathVista using the original Mulberry dataset and the augmented SFT dataset.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T7.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T7.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Method</th>
<th id="A2.T7.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Mathvista</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T7.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Qwen2.5-VL-7B(Baseline)</th>
<td id="A2.T7.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">68.2</td></tr>
