</figure>
<figure id="A7.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.13031v1/fig6_appendix.png" id="A7.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:698/321;" width="698" height="321" alt="Refer to caption">
